# #5833. The lazy arm drops its replay to foreignHigh: the activation passes an append
# another activation of the leaf made before the arm. It edits the Armed predicate, not
# an action, so it names no perturbed action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestArmWithoutForeignHighReplay
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the lazy arm skips the replay to foreignHigh

--- FIND
    /\ IF WithPreArm THEN rp[a] >= seenP[a] ELSE rp[a] >= claimHead[a] - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no replay to foreignHigh.
    /\ IF WithPreArm THEN TRUE ELSE rp[a] >= claimHead[a] - 1
--- END
